    "title": "<p>Table. Provisional genetic subtypes and recommended&nbsp;terminology of Pigmented epithelioid&nbsp;melanocytoma&nbsp;(PEM). The genetic background/driving mutation determines the subtype of PEM (see Pathogenesis). If known, the subtype should further be modified by the PEM-defining abnormality present. PRKAR1A inactivation is currently the only known PEM-defining abnormality. This terminology anticipates additional PEM-defining abnormalities in PRKAR1A wild-type PEMs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Artur Zembowicz",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; height: 511px; width: 1154px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 78px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 141px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 78px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">Subtype</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 78px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">Genetic background</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 220px; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-left: none; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 78px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"204\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">PRKA1R1-inactivation/another</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">PEM-defining abnormality</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 793px; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-left: none; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 78px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"276\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">Recommended terminology</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 30px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 141px; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-left: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 91px;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 141px; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-left: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 91px;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">Unknown</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 220px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 30px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"204\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\" align=\"center\">-</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 793px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 30px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"276\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">PEM</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 61px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 220px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 61px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"204\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 793px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 61px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"276\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">PRKAR1A - inactivated PEM</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; text-autospace: none;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 141px; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; border-bottom